{"id":"8e5c68abd6a53a1d","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-schnorr-kolm.md","title":"Schnorr 随机性的机器复杂度刻画","display":"thm-schnorr-kolm — Schnorr 随机性的机器复杂度刻画","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-schnorr-kolm","aliases":["43-thm-schnorr-kolm"],"display":"thm-schnorr-kolm — Schnorr 随机性的机器复杂度刻画","depends_on":["[[43-df-schnorrrandom]]","[[43-df-computable-prefix-machine]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§10.3.1 Theorem 10.3.3，印刷215–217，PDF235–237","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-schnorr-kolm"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-schnorr-kolm</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-schnorr-kolm — Schnorr 随机性的机器复杂度刻画"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c8d43a74ea8721f3\" href=\"?note=c8d43a74ea8721f3\" title=\"43-df-schnorrrandom\">43-df-schnorrrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"16634b9fc07ef245\" href=\"?note=16634b9fc07ef245\" title=\"43-df-computable-prefix-machine\">43-df-computable-prefix-machine</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§10.3.1 Theorem 10.3.3，印刷215–217，PDF235–237"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c8d43a74ea8721f3\" href=\"?note=c8d43a74ea8721f3\" title=\"43-df-schnorrrandom\">43-df-schnorrrandom</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComputablePrefixMachine}\">\\(\\mathrm{ComputablePrefixMachine}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_M\">\\(K_M\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"16634b9fc07ef245\" href=\"?note=16634b9fc07ef245\" title=\"43-df-computable-prefix-machine\">43-df-computable-prefix-machine</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 遍历有限二进制串上的部分函数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}(X)\\iff\\forall M\\;\\left(\\mathrm{ComputablePrefixMachine}(M)\\Rightarrow\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;K_M(X\\upharpoonright n)\\ge n-c\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}(X)\\iff\\forall M\\;\\left(\\mathrm{ComputablePrefixMachine}(M)\\Rightarrow\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;K_M(X\\upharpoonright n)\\ge n-c\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>替换未经原书支持的固定最优K与任意h的旧式。源书刻画量化所有停机概率可计算的前缀机器；常数可以依赖M与X。</p>\n<p>来源：§10.3.1 Theorem 10.3.3，印刷215–217，PDF235–237。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-schnorrrandom","status":"resolved","id":"c8d43a74ea8721f3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-schnorrrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable-prefix-machine","status":"resolved","id":"16634b9fc07ef245","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable-prefix-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-schnorrrandom","status":"resolved","id":"c8d43a74ea8721f3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$；$\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}$ 见 [[43-df-schnorrrandom]]，$\\mathrm{ComputablePrefixMachine}$、$K_M$ 见 [[43-df-computable-prefix-machine]]。$M$ 遍历有限二进制串上的部分函数。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable-prefix-machine","status":"resolved","id":"16634b9fc07ef245","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$；$\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}$ 见 [[43-df-schnorrrandom]]，$\\mathrm{ComputablePrefixMachine}$、$K_M$ 见 [[43-df-computable-prefix-machine]]。$M$ 遍历有限二进制串上的部分函数。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ComputablePrefixMachine}","display":false},{"tex":"K_M","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}(X)\\iff\\forall M\\;\\left(\\mathrm{ComputablePrefixMachine}(M)\\Rightarrow\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;K_M(X\\upharpoonright n)\\ge n-c\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1345,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-233","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-schnorr-kolm]] — Schnorr 随机性的机器复杂度刻画"}],"outgoing":["c8d43a74ea8721f3","16634b9fc07ef245"]}